      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 11,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Timeline guides\nPin images or clips, optionally with audio, to frames of the generated video. Each **MiniMax H3 Add Guide** adds one guide; chain them and connect the last one to Generate Video `timeline_guides`.\n\n- Guide 1: image at frame **36** (1.5 s)\n- Guide 2: image at frame **72** (3 s)\n- Guide 3: clip at frame **-22**, ending on the last frame, with its own soundtrack from Get Video Components\n\nSelect your own files; the loader filenames are placeholders. A clip's soundtrack is only used when connected to `audio`. Each guide takes `image`, `video`, `audio`, `image`+`audio` or `video`+`audio`; at most 8 guides.\n\n**Output:** 24 FPS is required with guides. 124 frames (~5.17 s); negative indices count from the end. The server shortens a clip to 17k+5 frames (or 1) and rejects a guide that does not fit.\n\nBase H3: 50 steps, video flow shift 12, audio flow shift 3. FastH3 does not accept timeline guides."
      ],
      "title": "Timeline guide inputs and limits",
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    }
